# Quality Gate

When changing Python code in this repo:

1. Prefer editing under `app/` and tests under `tests/`.
2. Keep formatting/lint aligned with Ruff config in `pyproject.toml`.
3. Before finishing a task, run from repo root (with `.venv` activated):

```bash
ruff check app tests
ruff format --check app tests
pyright
pytest
```

4. Fix failures you introduced; do not weaken tool configs to silence them without discussion.
